{{--
    A single media component: this file holds ONE file_id or URL and nothing else.
    Its presence is what selects the Telegram method (photo.php → sendPhoto,
    video.php → sendVideo, and so on). Only one media component per view.

    Pass the value in from the controller:
      view('promo', ['file_id' => $fileId])

    A file_id is returned by Services\MediaUploader when you upload a local file,
    or read off an incoming update with BotRequest::fileId(). photo, video,
    document, audio, voice and animation also accept a plain https:// URL.
--}}
{{ $file_id ?? '' }}
